  <item>
    <title>100.慕尼黑，城市很富足。与女儿CARA欧洲旅行的最后一站。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a880ed7ef65145dfcc3214c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a880ed7ef65145dfcc3214c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 08:47:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>慕尼黑第一天：欧洲的火车，慕尼黑火车站去酒店有点曲折，巴伐利亞霍夫酒店（Hotel Bayerischer Hof）不错，圣母教堂，非常好吃的德国菜，Riviera Records黑胶店的展现形式很好，阿桑教堂不大坏但很好看，Optimal Records，Doc's LP/CD/DVD-Börse非常大，慕尼黑皇宮，新市政廳塔樓上的木偶鐘，五庭院購物廊，邁克爾·傑克遜紀念雕像，HB皇家啤酒馆不好吃。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuH6xSwyf5FCuWk2UJFvGSnYv_DZ.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuYFLMuHfjiYsVQzo4YgHLmwvpiG.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiqtyMmT304zv8x64CMsz4yM9a82.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpJi3kg_4XVCm9XP7gVMgt9JHlye.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvH9NnxCBIGGhXfc90KH_ZI_-Hgo.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtD1o4DdfWZ4b4znkiSvk0Z5xIT5.png"><p><span>慕尼黑第二天：新天鹅堡，菲森 Füssen小镇，奧古斯丁 Augustiner啤酒一般。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNzwNTyayGvB4ejDUldbjh_rfQI.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtT1mUUHVc1m1H27_tVHoV7N0R-8.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeBIkvEXao7O4GhXGkTDGApVfbA.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGp9ovxFvXBlWImPf4mGNHtqPw8.png"><p><span>慕尼黑第三天：车麦当劳，老绘画馆，现代艺术复兴馆，芬兰建筑师马蒂·苏罗宁1968年设计的 Futuro House，兰德霍斯特博物馆，Best Records 唱片店，旧书店买了两幅版画，Lost Weekend 的复合文化空间，Magazin 的选品家具店，好吃的意大利餐馆。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBAt_6c-jZFjg5Vky_wLr5MBMvA.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmk8x0pLjBipe_bRBqNgmuhdf8x_.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk8dcmd2jorhfOygPgyE8S_Etjkq.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmksRw5VfkAqnpjV3DN0Ya2Rr1MM.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjjnk7YUaf2v2GWRyurmahy7Uz2J.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhIl2jF9KBfNRu4iOjRixqNJuJyT.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuEoK2RBcw8KDkxXvMmsPMqLiUZ8.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flr0DZYfeyKa-l5kacG6mpzSx5Kj.png"><p><span>与cara的欧洲之旅播客结束了，下一次应该是和她录制东京玩耍的播客，喜欢您来听。</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/603d8cd7b3814560cb2e0021/lnID4TN4GcPIigKBdAZZXYB0-1iY.m4a" length="53864382" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4hoKr2nV4o8Xt4PYPsE7DJdjXZ.png"/>
