  <item>
    <title>94.和女儿cara旅行的第二天，维也纳瓦豪河谷</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6379c46356eb2d9be7e6c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6379c46356eb2d9be7e6c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>维也纳第二天，周边小镇溜达。重庆籍司机老哥，看到了一些现代高楼建筑，看到了多瑙河，克里姆斯镇演出的老人们，多瑙河之眼，梅尔克修道院，皇帝煎饼不好吃，蓝白教堂，迪恩施泰因小镇，晚餐tantan。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiOXkeFADdvvUV6OR4XiTzkv4zDx.jpeg"><p><span>多瑙河的第一眼，邮轮可以走三个小时。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqEgGSt90qvVpDj5XK75fVK4eVh7.jpeg"><p><span>小镇的门</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nmY3lpQ7H9KoHDYDH9Mr04EDzc4R.jpeg"><p><span>小镇里玩耍八音盒的老人</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nle3aNYSAJHbJ4-Xg_JKTUjxjifL.jpeg"><p><span>赶上了小镇老年乐队的演出尾声。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnFnWTzLmIqiemcpWXtZ4TvM4PZZ.jpeg"><p><span>多瑙河之眼，cara创作着。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ngdvDXqwZcRZmV0JDvZL36tjrHQQ.jpeg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nmEbCQ0RbJ_Qsl3PmGnJ-OFIWO_z.jpeg"><p><span>雄伟的修道院，以及当代艺术家创作的壁画。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ngp1wN5reLLYSFUcyvfpBl3UJOJZ.jpeg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nn173uk-d2M2X4KFlG8r4V55YW_8.jpeg"><p><span>维也纳香肠和皇帝煎饼都不好吃。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm6faMgfLwisK1FuGxSPbFCRDvi5.jpeg"><p><span>蓝白教堂。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkvF4EXgJQ8ocHzmBwYnp5sTp6N5.jpeg"><p><span>蓝白教堂下多瑙河畔的情侣。</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ng2VQ7SCwKm5LVKZUhj2q-l4ESjv.jpeg"><p><span>百水设计的垃圾焚烧厂。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkV-B-FUQaArK4NsULGq2pbjwfij.jpeg"><p><span>tantan的虎皮尖椒凉菜</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
