    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlAAjXCCACtQyaGVnGNftbJGkI2L.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmWaoxILlgjpjyHlj0nZ5Ay81B7a.png"></figure><p><span>波特兰丽思卡尔顿很像中国的了哈。</span></p><p><span>Everyday Music、Powell's City of Books（全美最大独立书店）、Pearl District。</span></p><p><span> Huber's（桌边焰烧西班牙咖啡）</span></p><p><span>几个好逛的街区： Alberta + E Burnside + Hawthorne + Division</span></p><p><span> Broken Dreams、Melville Books、Music Millennium、tomorrow Records、Jackpot Records、House of Vintage、The City Reader、selected Stories、2nd Avenue Records</span></p><p><span>Washington Park、International Rose Test Garden（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">7:30</a>am开，免费）、日本庭园（10am开）、Forest Park 、 Macleay Trail 、 Stone Hous</span></p><p><span>Monograph Bookwerks、Nucleus Portland、Passenger Seat Records、Mississippi Records（12-7pm）、Speck's Records（11-6pm）Nationale</span></p><p><span>Lan Su Chinese Garden（10am开，步行10分钟）</span></p><p></p><p><span>Oregon无消费税，标价即实付。Uber市区内单程约$8-15，机场约$25-40带现金备用。部分小店偏好现金。</span></p><ul><li><p></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
